<title>FINLAND: Finnish Jan trade surplus FIM 3.80 bln -customs.</title>
<headline>Finnish Jan trade surplus FIM 3.80 bln -customs.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's January trade surplus was 3.80 billion markka, the National Customs Board (NCB) said on Friday, releasing detailed figures to supplement an earlier announcement of a 4.0 billion markka surplus.</p>
<p>The value of exports rose 12 percent year-on-year in January while the value of imports rose five percent, NCB said in a statement. Trade balance (million markka):</p>
<p>		  Jan '97    Dec '96    Jan '96</p>
<p> Exports	 14,900     14,619     13,325</p>
<p> Imports	 11,096     12,764     10,526</p>
<p> Balance	 +3,804     +1,855     +2,799</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
